          <text x="30" y="70" fill="#fbbf24" font-size="16" font-weight="bold">M\u1ED1t (Mo): Gi\xE1 tr\u1ECB c\xF3 t\u1EA7n s\u1ED1 l\u1EDBn nh\u1EA5t</text>
